Conjugate heat transfer analysis of rectangular cooling channels using modeled and direct numerical simulation of turbulence
Francesco Nasuti a,b,∗, Andrea Torricelli a,b, Sergio Pirozzoli a,b
a Sapienza University of Rome, Italy b Dipartimento di Ingegneria Meccanica e Aerospaziale, Via Eudossiana 18, Rome I-00184, Italy
